# MoodleFlow is fully client-side: there is no server-side Moodle credential to
# configure. Each user enters their own Moodle site URL and web service token
# in the app (/connect), and both are stored only in that browser's
# localStorage. No environment variables are required to run MoodleFlow.
#
# This file is kept for parity with the project template and for any future
# build-time configuration (e.g. a default/demo site URL).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_MOODLE_URL=
